      "lines": [
        "[Am]Osacred [Em]head, [Dm]now [C]wounded, [G#m]With [Am]grief and shame weighed [Em]down,",
        "[Am]Now [F]scornfully [C]surrounded [G#m]With [Am]thorns, Thine only [Em]crown:",
        "[Am]Osacred [Dm]head, [Em]what [F]glory, [C]What bliss [F]till [A7/C#]now [Dm]was Thine!",
        "[D7/F#]Yet, [G]though despised [C/E]and [G/D]gory, I [C]joy [F/A]to [C/G]call [F]Thee [G]mine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Am]What [Em]thou, [C]my Lord, [Am]has suffered",
        "[Am]was [Em]all [C]for [G#m]sinners' [Am/E]gain;",
        "[Am]mine, [Em]mine [C]was the [Am]transgression,",
        "[Am]but [Em]thine [C]the [G#m]deadly [Am/E]pain.",
        "[Am]Lo, [Dm]here [F]I fall, [C]my [A7/C#]Savior!",
        "[Am]'Tis [Dm]I [F]deserve thy [Dm]place;",
        "[D7/F#]look [G]on [C/E]me with thy favor,",
        "[D7/F#]vouchsafe [C/E]to [G]me [F/A]thy grace."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Am]What [Em]language [C]shall [Am]I borrow",
        "[Am]to [Em]thank [C]thee, [G#m]dearest [Am/E]friend,",
        "[Am]for [Em]this [C]thy [G#m]dying [Am/C]sorrow,",
        "[Am]thy [Em]pity [G#m]without [Am/E]end?",
        "[Am]O [Dm]make [F]me thine [C]forever;",
        "[Am]and [Dm]should [F]I [C]fainting [Dm]be,",
        "[D7/F#]Lord, [G]let [C/E]me never, never",
        "[D7/F#]outlive [C/E]my [G]love [F/A]for thee."
      ]
